ia `npm config set prefix ~/.npm-global`. |\n19: | **npm Global Binaries** | `~/.npm-global/bin` | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | Symlinks/wrappers in user home PATH. |\n20: | **npm Project Packages** | `<project>/node_modules` | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | Local project dependencies. |\n21: | **npm Cache** | `~/.npm` | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | Package tarball cache. |\n22: | **Rust Toolchain (rustup)** | `~/.rustup` | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | Installed rustc, stdlib, cargo tools. |\n23: | **Cargo Binaries & Cache** | `~/.cargo/bin`, `~/.cargo/registry` | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | Cargo downloads and crates. |\n24: | **Rust Build Artifacts** | `<project>/target/` | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | Heavy build outputs (often 2-5 GB per project). |\n25: | **Java / OpenJDK** | `/usr/lib/jvm/` | `/` | 30 GB Root | JDK runtime (~300 MB). |\n26: | **Gradle / Maven Cache** | `~/.gradle`, `~/.m2` | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | Build tool artifact caches. |\n27: | **Google Chrome Binary** | `/opt/google/chrome` | `/` | 30 GB Root | Browser application files (~350 MB). |\n28: | **Chrome User Profile** | `~/.config/google-chrome` | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | Cookies, session state, browser cache, extensions. |\n29: | **Playwright Browsers** | `~/.cache/ms-playwright` | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | Downloaded browser engines (Chromium, Firefox, WebKit). |\n30: | **Antigravity CLI (AGY)** | `/home/azureuser/.local/bin/agy` | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | 214 MB standalone binary. |\n31: | **AGY Global Symlink** | `/usr/local/bin/agy` | `/` | 30 GB Root | 30-byte symlink only. |\n32: | **AGY Workspace** | `/home/azureuser/workspace` & projects | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | Workspaces, transcripts, artifacts. |\n33: | **AGY Database & Logs** | `~/.gemini/antigravity-cli/` | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | SQLite DB, `cli.log`, history, crash reports. |\n34: | **AGY Extracted Binaries** | `~/.gemini/antigravity-cli/bin/` | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | e.g. `webm_encoder` (17 MB). |\n35: | **Temporary Files** | `/home/azureuser/tmp` | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | Redirected via persistent `TMPDIR=/home/azureuser/tmp`. |\n36: | **SQLite Databases** | `<project>/*.db`, `*.sqlite`, `*.session` | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | In-tree project databases and Telethon auth sessions. |\n37: | **CockroachDB Store** | `<project>/tools/cockroach-data/` | `/home` | 220 GB NVMe | Dedicated store path under `/home`. |\n38: | **PostgreSQL (default)** | `/var/lib/postgresql/` | `/` | 30 GB Root | System service default (can redirect to `/home/postgres_data`). |\n39: | **System Logs** | `/var/log/journal/` | `/` | 30 GB Root | Systemd journal (rotated and clamped). |\n40: \n41: ---\n42: \n43: ## B. ROOT-DISK LEAK REPORT (Every vector that can write to the 30 GB root disk)\n44: \n45: 1. **Unset TMPDIR (PROVEN & MITIGATED):**\n46:    - *Risk:* Without `TMPDIR`, Go, Node, Python, and AGY language servers write schemas and temp files to `/tmp` on root disk.\n47:    - *Evidence:* Live test revealed `/tmp/unleash-repo-schema-v1-...json` (463 KB) on root.\n48:    - *Mitigation:* Set `export TMPDIR=\"/home/azureuser/tmp\"` in `~/.bashrc` and `~/.profile`. Retest verified 0 bytes written to root `/tmp`.\n49: 2. **Global sudo pip installations:**\n50:    - *Risk:* Running `sudo pip install` places wheels in `/usr/local/lib/python3.x/dist-packages/` on root.\n51:    - *Mitigation:* Enforce `pip install --user` or virtual environments (`python3 -m venv`).\n52: 3. **Global npm installations without user prefix:**\n53:    - *Risk:* Running `sudo npm install -g` places packages in `/usr/local/lib/node_modules/` on root.\n54:    - *Mitigation:* Enforce `npm config set prefix '~/.npm-global'` on Azure.\n55: 4. **PostgreSQL Default Data Directory:**\n56:    - *Risk:* Standard PostgreSQL stores tables in `/var/lib/postgresql/17/main/` on root.\n57:    - *Mitigation:* Symlink or set `data_directory = '/home/postgres_data'` in `postgresql.conf`.\n58: 5. **APT Package Cache:**\n59:    - *Risk:* Large apt downloads remain in `/var/cache/apt/archives/`.\